    - the child exits 0;
    - conhosts.py: the child is not running; 1 conhost.exe, whose parent is the PARENT shell, created before the child's register
      stamp; 0 under the child;
    - bgcheck check exit 0 ("0 running").
  - WHY the conhost and the PASS: the child inherits the parent's console, so it gets no conhost of its own. The parent's conhost
    is the parent's child, not a descendant of the registered root. It was created before the root, so it is outside the check's
    candidate window, and its environment predates the tag.
